#: kwelcome.cc:40
msgid "Welcome to the K Desktop Environment!"
msgstr "Welkom by die K Desktop Environment"

#: kwelcome.cc:69
msgid "&About KDE"
msgstr "&Aangaande KDE"

#: kwelcome.cc:76
msgid "Show this dialog on KDE startup."
msgstr "Vertoon hierdie dialoog met nuwe KDE sessie"

#: kwelcome.cc:89
msgid "Get &help"
msgstr "Kry &hulp"

#: kwelcome.cc:96
msgid "Configuration &wizard"
msgstr "Konfigurasiewysgeer"

#: kwelcome.cc:113
msgid ""
"\n"
"The KDE Desktop Environment was written by the KDE Team,\n"
"a world-wide network of software engineers committed to\n"
"free software development.\n"
"\n"
"Visit http://www.kde.org for more information on the KDE\n"
"Project. Please consider joining and supporting KDE.\n"
"\n"
"Please report bugs at http://bugs.kde.org.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Die KDE Desktop Environment is geskryf deur die KDE span,\n"
"'n wêreldwye netwerk van sagteware ingenieurs wat \n"
"gratis sagteware ontwikkeling voorstaan.\n"
"\n"
"Besoek http://www.kde.org vir meer inligting oor die KDE\n"
"projek. Dink daaraan om by KDE aan te sluit en dit te ondersteun.\n"
"\n"
"Rapporteer asb. foute by http://bugs.kde.org.\n"
""

#: kwelcome.cc:118
msgid "About KDE"
msgstr "Aangaande KDE"
